{"id": "clm:b94e3cd8a3c7ffb9df4e02bc4b4a0abd3215493edb439e441ebee14f71972280", "type": "statement", "text": "Duplo says the DC-648 camera scans barcodes and registration marks; job preparation and mark handling are part of the automation workflow. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/product/dc-648-slitter-cutter-creaser/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "structure", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:f87701cd9bea261b8dfe05ce519a454561967a7e548958ff3795189686fa2487"]}
{"id": "clm:ed5bd82b40b4b81cc751bcd5bdff54b9cbfb34c441a85faae161bb84039f13f5", "type": "statement", "text": "The DC-ST100 brochure distinguishes automatic changeover for one to three stacks across from semi-automatic changeover for four or five. Its automation claim therefore has a layout-dependent limit. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DC-ST100-In-Line-Stacker-Brochure_0326.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:48ea3c79696a677e1a3d0be20e148c5435059d14697d34d0050cf2e4fdfaf220"]}
{"id": "clm:e4da25263a8eef45bcc60ad06116088dcb4f8d12cf08206e25d28bba3058448b", "type": "statement", "text": "The Uchida AeroCut nano operation manual warns that the machine cannot detect a double feed occurring with the first fed sheet. Double-feed detection alone therefore does not establish complete-deck integrity. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mybinding.com/cdn/shop/files/AEROCUT-NANO-operation-manual.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5fb931cf5768a2972f16250cee68769e4ba923610b52fa9d2ae7ed4602efc1b9"]}
{"id": "clm:624a67c9f5b6636a245fb3145f466a9a134ac919a44efbc6fbe8206d007f2ff0", "type": "statement", "text": "Equipment dealer/service provider Print & Finishing Solutions says heavy static charge can cause misfeeds, double feeds or jams on air-feed cutters. Treat this as attributed service guidance, not a measured failure rate. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.pfsgraphics.com/resources-slitter-cutters-trimmers", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:7ee54b39fdef559a42c10a5a8c872e211f868080c61cbdf39c9e2930eff8281b", "ev:c9121364c82b42ae098951388e617c043f1588fb6df60901bfefb4b632e940ee", "ev:ecbc03a8d24eccd5125b06af3a564c6640140790d37146b894903fa5a3762f70"]}
{"id": "clm:28b110f94c72cce8cc9751025413b4caf244cde198273de330c37944820ee3ba", "type": "statement", "text": "Duplo describes the DC-648 as a single-pass slitting, cutting, creasing and perforating finisher for digitally printed sheets. This describes finishing automation, rather than evidence of a complete printed and boxed game. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/product/dc-648-slitter-cutter-creaser/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:261d6e83aae5ea3c0e9bb3c9ac346b323b40a4e51e2d867ca10c7acc56db0dac"]}
{"id": "clm:b5acad3e1ea52658c973401b920bda8060a2c6a322451459ab7c3dc180804e62", "type": "statement", "text": "The reviewed offerings advertise different output stages: AeroCut Nano cutting/slitting, Duplo batch stacking, and Rollem collation with downstream finishing options. Evaluate a proposed compact system against every required stage rather than treating card cutting or stacking as proof of a complete game. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://plockmaticgroup.com/morgana/product/aerocut-nano/?geo=us", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.duplousa.com/product/dc-st100-in-line-stacker/", "https://rollem.com/machines/slipstream-iii/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:20ef3adc53b59ee6a53f9b5775d39751ef31d944028e1c287a19ff8e5d9e37cb", "ev:a104b42c4252d311891809786cb57db9785051f04e711aab86689869a801ab1d", "ev:b58d3de2aa76b4103077b797a64d1dd9daf42cfcabdc73c3439c44fc16d6db44"]}
{"id": "clm:5977688f0776943352f10d318a03bf426ebd5ec570aa8139cdfaa5f146487105", "type": "statement", "text": "MBM specifies the tabletop Precision Card Pro at 18.5 by 23 by 13 inches (depth, width, height); this compactness measurement applies to its slitter/cutter. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://mbmcorp.com/product/precision-card-pro/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3a8c9f299aee749ef47a60ef7b4d4ef11fda3d4ed83caa75a7384200ba04a867", "ev:d1f7b22d30e85798c0bffe0e07601cc0b0610c50f542c7cd4549193df58271a4"]}
{"id": "clm:f08c62a9239c79b20ad240c49555e91d22bd4e52858e8d5423b5074bbc397400", "type": "statement", "text": "Do not equate cutter speed with completed-game throughput: Duplo rates the DC-648 in sheets per minute, while MBM qualifies its card rate by letter-size paper and single-cut cards. Neither rating measures completion of the commissioned game. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/product/dc-648-slitter-cutter-creaser/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://mbmcorp.com/product/precision-card-pro/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:56f0c2ed5d8e79c6d78f5a349dbac6a22c06c85b69ab722be5c40097688ddd59", "ev:bf04caa52d6f92d1094d5dc3dbc70be0b8630bda340c4d62989471693ebec84a"]}
{"id": "clm:42cca0cb1349599118da9c5328a7cd9a2f4c914873a8f84d7b4ea93b9f420020", "type": "statement", "text": "Duplo describes the DC-ST100 as supporting programmable batch separation and removal of completed stacks while operation continues. These features address output handling; they do not by themselves demonstrate correctly collated game decks. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/product/dc-st100-in-line-stacker/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:d4369e8e41c4f5ee9885a5b5e87fa94c734d291766eaab5c710e082334b14013"]}
{"id": "clm:23b1d55dac958393219424c3e928161fef30f2b157999e5340f4c0f228dc9bc3", "type": "statement", "text": "The DC-ST100 specification restricts paper weight to 230–400 gsm and maximum stack height to 40 mm; qualify the finished stock against the stacker as well as the cutter. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/product/dc-st100-in-line-stacker/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:c74fb4c615b1f46017f1c36508b4dfe57462f6dbf2dd12e4da0c0862262b7eb9"]}
{"id": "clm:3baa66a0ae5f14a6e8273c9058a9bece80340bf2d5e284c816b9bb0593f65f0f", "type": "statement", "text": "Rollem describes the SlipStream III as able to cut, collate, punch and wrap in one pass, and says a deck can span multiple sheets. This is manufacturer evidence of integrated deck finishing, not measured performance for the commissioned game. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://rollem.com/news/monthly-new-feature-slipstream-iii-collator/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5bab9f3e68c77e6b508e845510e67db06ccbc3f01458c9e160bf1bbd060fdbeb", "ev:5ffa33c2243effab8443bf330ea6c88a72c7afadac09d314598d58737717ee13"]}
{"id": "clm:e3704ea817be9de49f2a2a9faab078c80d051742159d2191b227117512c4b4ba", "type": "statement", "text": "Rollem positions its AutoCollator for lower-volume or space-constrained applications, with cards presented downstream for punching, wrapping or packing. Its lower-volume positioning does not establish that every downstream operation is included in a compact unit. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://rollem.com/processes/collate/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:ce63d4cdeb72bcf754ea7e7f089180c1155602c0ca518d7cc1c62ac378ea9e35"]}
{"id": "clm:a3b566d93483e8de8e2f1a5ef7d5bb843de1c6556f3d1c416299f740ebe23bd6", "type": "statement", "text": "In supplier-submitted material dated July 13, 2026, Rollem describes Cardistry as integrating slitting, cutting, collation, verification and boxing, rated up to 60 finished packs per minute. Treat the rate as a supplier claim; this article provides no independent game-specific throughput measurement. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-07-13)", "source_url": "https://www.packworld.com/coding-printing-labeling/package-printing/product/22970467/rollem-automated-card-pack-production-system", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5a2e0d55c660dbca2d3439a7f135c162562c4d3acc097f51c31ed75a4f9d4bd7"]}
{"id": "clm:2a25420410468904e9b17865ac98c91b6c342d054a722864ffae2ba47e54637b", "type": "statement", "text": "Historical operator accounts disagree about unattended finishing: in the November 2020 PrintPlanet discussion, Wheate valued being able to perform other cutting work while a Duplo ran; SoggyWinter reported recurring feeder attention to avoid double feeds. These are model- and shop-specific anecdotes, not current reliability rates. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://printplanet.com/threads/duplo-finishing-machines.290798/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:88e5648f9d669a1958fea652404c1b756040ad29573686b51b83a245f281395a", "ev:a74de4d6e84d6dd43098668d4931e4dcd9b9a12ff2d3c9496c240695f6bc79d1"]}
{"id": "clm:95c01d0b4c8a047151ced1956b0d067600eaa88ac283da78f314d6956cf7f5d9", "type": "statement", "text": "Morgana describes the AeroCut Nano as an entry-level cutting/slitting model and says its cutters can be manually adjusted for specific job sizes; the specified machine dimensions are 565(W) x632(D) x963(H) mm. This documents a compact cutter with setup work. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://plockmaticgroup.com/morgana/product/aerocut-nano/?geo=us", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:84e5773d25bbc9e85eee145313de7718afb8da3c4cbb1ac9ba7eada1c352aa26", "ev:c887f3941d179a058a4640212b9500e60c28c4cc6c4339e60f613c2e20fbd8f3"]}
{"id": "clm:60db8bd306e3f9bc5fb49b552aec70b20a4b1137d127d591668df4fe4777a7b2", "type": "statement", "text": "Duplo rates the DC-648 at a maximum of 40 sheets per minute and advertises slitting, cutting, creasing and perforating in one pass. This is a sheet-finishing rating, not a measured finished-deck rate. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/product/dc-648-slitter-cutter-creaser/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:25cf4e6ef96a5521a6be9913293d5e4ccbbe0e46abe3d6a064cb514c003c8c89", "ev:261d6e83aae5ea3c0e9bb3c9ac346b323b40a4e51e2d867ca10c7acc56db0dac"]}
{"id": "clm:eb105a8bb8f4663ed8a1273e243dd5d0f2c1246b29e8f86fbbedc3dfb6c71f68", "type": "statement", "text": "Duplo’s DC-ST100 brochure, marked 0326, lists the connected DC-648/stacker dimensions as 126 by 35 by 47 inches. Floor-space planning should use the connected configuration. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.duplousa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DC-ST100-In-Line-Stacker-Brochure_0326.pdf", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3d562d9621b880593f2a3694500922adb643f00b49d4393c976c3cfa22fd42fa", "ev:4a985346d3adbbf0b19f1800d2028515c326d632dc1875f8a30babb402396809"]}
{"id": "clm:e0f5ae1300eb7a0dd5d4ceab0302a92fd64e2e71691c1f94d84df8e5941d9632", "type": "statement", "text": "Rollem describes the SlipStream III as trimming/slitting sheets in two directions and collating them in one pass, with die-cutting, punching and packaging offered downstream. This explicitly describes deck assembly capability beyond ordinary card cutting. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://rollem.com/machines/slipstream-iii/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:ec3d50541210eb93690ba4cd3aa7a4cf6737c9ceabadd404f5ce91b8c07b5c16"]}
{"id": "clm:2a01817345731c02c2ed539cd3e5b71e7e44399d7200df7363faedc7dcd3a3c8", "type": "statement", "text": "In its February 2018 installation announcement, operator NAPCO/Vulcan said its Rollem MK2 Slipstream could slit, trim, collate, stack, round corners, box and wrap inline. This is historical operator-reported capability, not an independent acceptance test or proof of a compact configuration. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://vulcaninformationpackaging.com/napco-vulcan-introduce-playing-card-manufacturing/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:aa3a59aa1c3bbd2207ee1957a3fa66f4dcc30b011090c98074e8881fc1c2cc47"]}
{"id": "clm:14ed4ac3662f2c76c26ebd89352645eed43c34dd8152fa6e8dbfea274e9fdd3a", "type": "statement", "text": "MBM’s Precision Card Pro product page displays $7,244 for the slitter and cutter. This is a displayed equipment price, not a configured printer-to-boxed-game quotation; currency selection, tax, freight and installed-cost inclusions were not established. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-06)", "source_url": "https://mbmcorp.com/product/precision-card-pro/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Compact integrated card production automation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:dfe803976fff60e002c38d98517afc240d70cc175d750ed7586734abbae207bd", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3caabf55435dbdbcb4d0da16b2f6901ce3c5901dc7f7254056df7248f19abe68"]}
